    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/660e8dd16c876a8814cef88c713fef10.poster.avif?t=1666122207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/660e8dd16c876a8814cef88c713fef10.webm?t=1666122207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/660e8dd16c876a8814cef88c713fef10.mp4?t=1666122207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">game play</h2><strong>PAVOR</strong> is an online cooperative survival horror game for 1-4 players. You are a professional electrical repair and ghost exterminator, repairing broken houses and exterminating ghosts as requested.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play with your friends/h2]<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online cooperative play for 1 to 4 players</li></ul>\u3000Work with your friends to fix the electricity in the house and exterminate the ghosts.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>single-player</li></ul>\u3000There are no dependable companions, if you are caught, you are finished immediately, face your fears.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">voice chat</h2>\u3000Just as in reality, your voice will be heard by your friends near you, but not those far away.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/194629b31c97f1347d84353126c67f30.poster.avif?t=1666122207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/194629b31c97f1347d84353126c67f30.webm?t=1666122207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107080/extras/194629b31c97f1347d84353126c67f30.mp4?t=1666122207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Confronting Ghosts</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use a strobe to temporarily stop the ghosting.</li></ul>However, once the strobe is used, it cannot be used again until the fuse is picked up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New systems and maps will be added.</li></ul></h2>",
